msgid "Maqsadga erishish uchun topshiriq va muddatlarni rejalashtiring."
msgstr "Plan the tasks and the dates to reach your goal."

msgid "Dars ishlanmasi, video va boshqa ishlaringizni yuklang."
msgstr "Upload your lesson plan, your video and your other work."

msgid "Gibbs yoki Kolb modeli bilan o‘z ishingiz haqida o‘ylang."
msgstr "Think about your work with the Gibbs or the Kolb model."

msgid "Ustoz mezonlar bo‘yicha ball qo‘yadi va tavsiya beradi."
msgstr "Your teacher gives scores and advice."

msgid "Tavsiyalar asosida ishni yaxshilab, yangi versiya yuklang."
msgstr "Use the advice to make your work better. Then upload a new version."

msgid "Boshlang‘ich va oxirgi natijani yonma-yon ko‘ring."
msgstr "See your first and your latest result side by side."

msgid "Maqsad va reja"
msgstr "Goals and plans"

msgid "Maqsad qo‘ying va yo‘lingizni rejalashtiring"
msgstr "Set a goal and plan your way"

msgid "Har bir maqsadda kompetensiya, muddat va kutilgan natija bo‘ladi. Ustozlar topshiriq beradi, muddatlardan oldin esa eslatma kelib turadi."
msgstr "Each goal has a skill, a date and the result you want. Teachers give tasks, and you get reminders before the dates."

msgid "Ishlaringizni versiyalari bilan saqlang"
msgstr "Keep your work with all its versions"

msgid "Dars ishlanmasi, video, audio, rasm va taqdimotlarni yuklang. Har bir versiya saqlanadi va hech qachon o‘chirilmaydi."
msgstr "Upload lesson plans, videos, audio, pictures and slides. Every version is saved and is never deleted."

msgid "Gibbs yoki Kolb modeli bilan o‘ylang"
msgstr "Think with the Gibbs or the Kolb model"

msgid "Model refleksiyani aniq bosqichlarga bo‘lib beradi. Javob yozgan sari progressni ko‘rasiz."
msgstr "A model splits your self-review into clear stages. You see your progress as you write."

msgid "O‘sishingizni raqamlarda ko‘ring"
msgstr "See your growth in numbers"

msgid "Boshlang‘ich va oxirgi natija, mezonlar bo‘yicha ballar va ustoz fikrlari tarixi bitta sahifada."
msgstr "Your first and latest result, the scores for each score area and the history of teacher comments are on one page."

msgid "Versiyali portfolio"
msgstr "Work with versions"

msgid "Ishning har bir versiyasi saqlanadi, shuning uchun o‘sish tarixi to‘liq ko‘rinadi."
msgstr "Every version of your work is saved, so you can see the whole story of your growth."

msgid "Refleksiya modellari"
msgstr "Self-review models"

msgid "Gibbs va Kolb sikllari: savollar bosqichlarga bo‘lingan, to‘ldirilish darajasi ko‘rinib turadi."
msgstr "Gibbs and Kolb cycles: the questions are in stages, and you can see how much you finished."

msgid "Aniq baholash mezonlari"
msgstr "Clear score areas"

msgid "Ustoz har bir mezon bo‘yicha ball va izoh beradi, nimani yaxshilash kerakligi aniq bo‘ladi."
msgstr "Your teacher gives a score and a comment for each area, so you know what to improve."

msgid "Maqsadlar va topshiriqlar"
msgstr "Goals and tasks"

msgid "Maqsad qo‘ying, topshiriqni qabul qiling, muddatni kuzating."
msgstr "Set a goal, accept a task and watch the date."

msgid "Tahlil va taqqoslash"
msgstr "Reports and comparison"

msgid "Boshlang‘ich va oxirgi natija, dinamika grafiklari va modellar bo‘yicha tahlil."
msgstr "First and latest result, growth charts and a report for each self-review model."

msgid "Yangi topshiriq, ustoz fikri va muddat eslatmalari o‘z tilingizda keladi."
msgstr "New tasks, teacher comments and date reminders come in your own language."

msgid "Ikki til"
msgstr "Two languages"

msgid "Sayt ingliz va o‘zbek tillarida ishlaydi. Tanlovingiz eslab qolinadi."
msgstr "The site works in English and Uzbek. It remembers your choice."

msgid "Xavfsizlik"
msgstr "Safety"

msgid "Fayllar yopiq, har bir amal jurnalga yoziladi, ruxsatlar rolga qarab beriladi."
msgstr "Files are private, every action is written in a log, and each person sees only what their role allows."

msgid "Administrator foydalanuvchilarni Excel fayldan birdaniga qo‘shadi."
msgstr "The admin adds many users at once from an Excel file."

msgid "Platformaga kim kira oladi?"
msgstr "Who can sign in?"

msgid "Administrator yaratgan talaba, ustoz va administrator hisoblari. O‘zingiz ro‘yxatdan o‘ta olmaysiz."
msgstr "Students, teachers and admins whose accounts the admin made. You cannot sign up by yourself."

msgid "Parolimni unutsam, nima qilaman?"
msgstr "What if I forget my password?"

msgid "Qanday fayllarni yuklash mumkin?"
msgstr "Which files can I upload?"

msgid "Refleksiya modelini almashtirsam bo‘ladimi?"
msgstr "Can I change the self-review model?"

msgid "Ha, ustozga yuborguncha. Javoblaringiz mos bosqichlarga ko‘chiriladi, hech narsa yo‘qolmaydi."
msgstr "Yes, until you send it to the teacher. Your answers move to the matching stages, and nothing is lost."

msgid "Ishimni kimlar ko‘ra oladi?"
msgstr "Who can see my work?"

msgid "Faqat siz, sizga biriktirilgan ustoz va administrator."
msgstr "Only you, the teacher who works with you, and the admin."

msgid "Sayt qaysi tillarda ishlaydi?"
msgstr "Which languages does the site use?"

msgid "Ingliz va o‘zbek tillarida. Tilni yuqoridagi tugma bilan almashtirasiz, tanlovingiz saqlanadi."
msgstr "English and Uzbek. Change the language with the button at the top. The site remembers your choice."

msgid "Maqsadlar va topshiriqlar bir joyda"
msgstr "Goals and tasks in one place"

msgid "Muddatlar haqida eslatmalar"
msgstr "Reminders about dates"

msgid "Holatingizni har doim ko‘rasiz"
msgstr "You always see your status"

msgid "Hujjat, video, audio, rasm va taqdimot"
msgstr "Documents, video, audio, pictures and slides"

msgid "Har bir yangi versiya alohida saqlanadi"
msgstr "Every new version is saved on its own"

msgid "Fayllar yopiq va xavfsiz"
msgstr "Your files are private and safe"

msgid "Gibbs: 6 bosqich"
msgstr "Gibbs: 6 stages"

msgid "Kolb: 4 bosqich"
msgstr "Kolb: 4 stages"

msgid "Ustozga yuborguncha modelni almashtirish mumkin"
msgstr "You can change the model until you send it to the teacher"

msgid "Boshlang‘ich va oxirgi natija taqqoslanadi"
msgstr "Your first and latest result are compared"

msgid "Ustoz fikrlari tarixi"
msgstr "History of teacher comments"

msgid "Maqsad qo‘yadi va topshiriqlarni bajaradi"
msgstr "Sets goals and does the tasks"

msgid "Ish yuklaydi va refleksiya yozadi"
msgstr "Uploads work and writes self-reviews"

msgid "Baholarini va o‘sishini ko‘radi"
msgstr "Sees scores and growth"

msgid "Topshiriq beradi va ishlarni ko‘radi"
msgstr "Gives tasks and reads the work"

msgid "Mezonlar bo‘yicha baholaydi va tavsiya yozadi"
msgstr "Scores each area and writes advice"

msgid "Talabalar o‘sishini kuzatadi"
msgstr "Watches how students grow"

msgid "Foydalanuvchilar va tuzilmani boshqaradi"
msgstr "Manages users and the school structure"

msgid "Mezonlar va refleksiya savollarini sozlaydi"
msgstr "Sets up score areas and self-review questions"

msgid "Umumiy analitikani ko‘radi"
msgstr "Sees the reports for the whole platform"

#, python-format
msgid "Hujjat, rasm, audio, video va taqdimot. Hajm: hujjat, rasm va audio %(doc)s MB gacha, video %(video)s MB gacha."
msgstr "Documents, pictures, audio, video and slides. Size: up to %(doc)s MB for documents, pictures and audio, and up to %(video)s MB for video."

msgid "Asosiy mazmunga o‘tish"
msgstr "Skip to the main content"

msgid "Menyuni ochish"
msgstr "Open the menu"

msgid "Boshqaruv panelini ochish"
msgstr "Open my dashboard"

msgid "Kasbiy o‘sish uchun platforma"
msgstr "A place to grow in your job"

msgid "Platforma haqida"
msgstr "About the platform"

msgid "Kasbiy o‘sish uchun refleksiv e-portfolio"
msgstr "A self-review e-portfolio for growing in your job"

msgid "Refleksiv e-portfolio — o‘z faoliyati haqida o‘ylash orqali kasbiy rivojlanishga yordam beradigan platforma. U muhim tajribalarni, olingan xulosalarni va o‘rganganlaringizni bir joyda saqlaydi."
msgstr "A self-review e-portfolio helps you grow in your job by thinking about your own work. It keeps your important experiences, your ideas and what you learned in one place."

msgid "Shu jarayon doimiy takomillashish va o‘sishni ta’minlaydi."
msgstr "This way you keep getting better and growing."

msgid "Yaqindan tanishing"
msgstr "Take a closer look"

msgid "Platforma nimalarga qodir"
msgstr "What the platform can do"

msgid "Platforma imkoniyatlari"
msgstr "Platform features"

msgid "Sakkiz bosqichli rivojlanish sikli"
msgstr "A growth cycle with eight steps"

msgid "Har bir bosqich oldingisiga tayanadi. Sikl takrorlanadi: har bir aylanishda siz biroz yuqoriroq darajaga chiqasiz."
msgstr "Each step builds on the one before it. The cycle repeats, and each time you reach a slightly higher level."

msgid "Ikkita mashhur refleksiya modeli"
msgstr "Two popular self-review models"

msgid "O‘zingizga mosini tanlang. Model savollarni bosqichlarga bo‘lib beradi va qaysi bosqichgacha yetganingizni ko‘rsatadi."
msgstr "Pick the one that fits you. A model puts the questions in stages and shows how far you have come."

msgid "Rivojlanish uchun kerakli hamma narsa"
msgstr "Everything you need to grow"

msgid "Har bir foydalanuvchi uchun o‘z kabineti"
msgstr "A space for every kind of user"

msgid "Ko‘p beriladigan savollar"
msgstr "Common questions"

msgid "Rivojlanishni bugun boshlang"
msgstr "Start growing today"

msgid "Administrator bergan login va parol bilan kiring."
msgstr "Sign in with the username and password from your admin."

msgid "Sahifa bo‘limlari"
msgstr "Page sections"

msgid "Hisob"
msgstr "Account"

msgid "Yuqoriga"
msgstr "Back to top"

